{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-stack-selection","title":"技术栈选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard/technology-stack-selection","wordCount":1664,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术栈选型\">技术栈选型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>构建个人仪表盘的技术选型决策影响深远——它决定了你能接入哪些数据源、能承载多大的数据量、以及未来迭代的灵活度。2026 年的个人仪表盘技术格局已经从「只有程序员能做」演变为一个从零代码到全栈自建的完整光谱。选型的核心原则不是「用最先进的技术」，而是「用最匹配你维护意愿的技术」——一个你愿意持续维护 3 年的简单方案，远胜于一个 3 个月后因为太复杂而被放弃的精密系统。本文提供从 SaaS 到自建前端的全栈选型框架，帮助你做出适合自己技能水平和时间预算的决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-架构分层与决策维度\">核心概念：架构分层与决策维度</h2><h3 id=\"个人数据栈的四层架构\">个人数据栈的四层架构</h3><p>无论选择什么具体技术，个人仪表盘系统都可以拆解为四个逻辑层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Layer 1: Data Sources&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Layer 2: Data Pipeline&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Layer 3: Storage&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Layer 4: Visualization&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;APIs, Files, Manual Input&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;ETL, Sync, Transform&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;Database, Files, Cloud&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;Dashboard, Reports, Alerts&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Layer 1: Data Sources\"] --&gt; B[\"Layer 2: Data Pipeline\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Layer 3: Storage\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Layer 4: Visualization\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"APIs, Files, Manual Input\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"ETL, Sync, Transform\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"Database, Files, Cloud\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"Dashboard, Reports, Alerts\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键决策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据源层</td>\n<td>从各设备/应用获取原始数据</td>\n<td>API vs 导出 vs 手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据管道层</td>\n<td>定时拉取、清洗、转换</td>\n<td>实时 vs 批量、托管 vs 自建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储层</td>\n<td>持久化时序数据和元数据</td>\n<td>时序数据库 vs 关系型 vs 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示层</td>\n<td>可视化、告警、报告</td>\n<td>通用工具 vs 定制前端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型决策矩阵\">选型决策矩阵</h3><p>基于三个维度评估技术方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>低要求</th>\n<th>中等要求</th>\n<th>高要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术能力</td>\n<td>不会写代码</td>\n<td>会写脚本/SQL</td>\n<td>全栈开发能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间投入</td>\n<td>&lt;1 小时/周维护</td>\n<td>2-4 小时/周</td>\n<td>可投入项目级时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制需求</td>\n<td>开箱即用即可</td>\n<td>需要自定义指标/视图</td>\n<td>完全自定义一切</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南-三条技术路径\">实战指南：三条技术路径</h2><h3 id=\"路径一-saas-集成方案-零-低代码\">路径一：SaaS 集成方案（零/低代码）</h3><p>适合人群：不想写代码但想要超越单一应用视图的用户。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐架构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Oura/Apple Watch/Garmin → Exist.io (自动聚合)&#10;                        → Apple Health (iOS原生汇总)&#10;                        → Google Fit (Android原生汇总)&#10;&#10;手动数据 → Notion / Airtable (结构化输入)&#10;         → Daylio (情绪日志)&#10;&#10;展示层 → Exist.io 仪表盘 (自动关联分析)&#10;       → Gyroscope (精美可视化)&#10;       → Apple Health 摘要页\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Oura/Apple Watch/Garmin → Exist.io (自动聚合)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        → Apple Health (iOS原生汇总)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        → Google Fit (Android原生汇总)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>手动数据 → Notion / Airtable (结构化输入)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         → Daylio (情绪日志)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>展示层 → Exist.io 仪表盘 (自动关联分析)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       → Gyroscope (精美可视化)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       → Apple Health 摘要页</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Exist.io 深度集成示例</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动数据源</td>\n<td>Oura、Fitbit、Garmin、Strava、RescueTime、Todoist、Weather 等 30+ 源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心能力</td>\n<td>自动发现指标间相关性（如「你在少喝咖啡的日子睡眠更好」）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局限</td>\n<td>无法自定义计算指标、数据保留有限、无原始数据访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>$6/月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据导出</td>\n<td>支持 CSV 批量导出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"路径二-grafana-时序数据库-中等技术\">路径二：Grafana + 时序数据库（中等技术）</h3><p>适合人群：会写脚本、熟悉 Docker、想要高度自定义但不想从零造轮子的工程师。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Data Sources&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Python ETL Scripts&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;InfluxDB / TimescaleDB&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Grafana&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Web Dashboard&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Mobile App read-only&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;Alerting via Telegram&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Data Sources\"] --&gt; B[\"Python ETL Scripts\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"InfluxDB / TimescaleDB\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Grafana\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Web Dashboard\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Mobile App read-only\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"Alerting via Telegram\"]</pre><p><strong>核心组件选型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>备选</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据管道</td>\n<td>Python + cron</td>\n<td>n8n, Node-RED</td>\n<td>Python 生态最丰富、API 库最全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序存储</td>\n<td>InfluxDB 3.0</td>\n<td>TimescaleDB, QuestDB</td>\n<td>专为时序数据设计、Grafana 原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>Grafana OSS</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>社区活跃、面板类型丰富、告警强大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>Docker Compose</td>\n<td>K8s (过度)</td>\n<td>单机足够、一键启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警</td>\n<td>Grafana Alerting → Telegram</td>\n<td>Email, Slack</td>\n<td>移动端即时推送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>InfluxDB 数据模型设计</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# InfluxDB Line Protocol 示例&#10;# measurement,tag=value field=value timestamp&#10;&#10;# 睡眠数据&#10;sleep,source=oura deep_minutes=85,rem_minutes=105,score=82 1704067200000000000&#10;&#10;# 心率汇总&#10;heart_rate,source=apple_watch resting=58,max=165,zone2_minutes=45 1704067200000000000&#10;&#10;# 主观评分&#10;mood,method=manual energy=7,stress=4,focus=8 1704067200000000000&#10;&#10;# 环境数据&#10;environment,room=bedroom temp=19.5,humidity=55,co2=620 1704067200000000000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># InfluxDB Line Protocol 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># measurement,tag=value field=value timestamp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 睡眠数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sleep,source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oura deep_minutes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,rem_minutes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">105</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">82</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1704067200000000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 心率汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">heart_rate,source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">apple_watch resting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">58</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">165</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,zone2_minutes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1704067200000000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 主观评分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mood,method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">manual energy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,stress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,focus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1704067200000000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 环境数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">environment,room</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bedroom temp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">19.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,humidity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,co2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">620</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1704067200000000000</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Grafana Dashboard 配置要点</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# docker-compose.yml 核心配置&#10;services:&#10;  influxdb:&#10;    image: influxdb:2.7&#10;    ports: [&#39;8086:8086&#39;]&#10;    volumes: [&#39;./influxdb-data:/var/lib/influxdb2&#39;]&#10;    environment:&#10;      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_MODE: setup&#10;      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_ORG: personal&#10;      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_BUCKET: health&#10;&#10;  grafana:&#10;    image: grafana/grafana-oss:10.3&#10;    ports: [&#39;3000:3000&#39;]&#10;    volumes: [&#39;./grafana-data:/var/lib/grafana&#39;]&#10;    depends_on: [influxdb]&#10;&#10;  etl:&#10;    build: ./etl&#10;    environment:&#10;      OURA_TOKEN: ${OURA_TOKEN}&#10;      INFLUX_URL: http://influxdb:8086&#10;    # 每小时运行一次数据同步\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker-compose.yml 核心配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  influxdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">influxdb:2.7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8086:8086'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./influxdb-data:/var/lib/influxdb2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_MODE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">setup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_ORG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">personal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      DOCKER_INFLUXDB_INIT_BUCKET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  grafana</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">grafana/grafana-oss:10.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3000:3000'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./grafana-data:/var/lib/grafana'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">influxdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  etl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./etl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      OURA_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${OURA_TOKEN}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      INFLUX_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://influxdb:8086</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 每小时运行一次数据同步</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路径三-自建全栈方案-高技术\">路径三：自建全栈方案（高技术）</h3><p>适合人群：有前端开发经验、追求极致定制、享受构建过程本身的全栈工程师。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐技术栈</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>技术选择</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前端框架</td>\n<td>Next.js 15 / Svelte 5</td>\n<td>SSR + 客户端交互、组件生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表库</td>\n<td>D3.js + Observable Plot / Apache ECharts</td>\n<td>完全自定义 vs 开箱即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 层</td>\n<td>tRPC / GraphQL</td>\n<td>类型安全、前后端协同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB 扩展</td>\n<td>关系型 + 时序能力兼具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度器</td>\n<td>Temporal / BullMQ</td>\n<td>复杂 ETL 工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>Vercel (前端) + Railway/Fly.io (后端)</td>\n<td>低运维成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证</td>\n<td>Clerk / NextAuth</td>\n<td>即使只有自己用也需要安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自建方案的独特优势</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 示例：自定义复合健康评分（商业工具无法实现的逻辑）&#10;def composite_health_score(data):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    加权健康评分，权重基于个人3个月的回归分析&#10;    确定了哪些指标对次日主观精力预测力最强&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    weights = {&#10;        &#39;sleep_score&#39;: 0.28,      # 通过回归确定&#10;        &#39;hrv_vs_baseline&#39;: 0.22,  # 个人化权重&#10;        &#39;exercise_zone2&#39;: 0.15,&#10;        &#39;stress_budget_remaining&#39;: 0.18,&#10;        &#39;social_connection&#39;: 0.10,&#10;        &#39;nutrition_score&#39;: 0.07,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    score = sum(&#10;        normalize(data[k]) * w&#10;        for k, w in weights.items()&#10;        if k in data&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;score&#39;: round(score * 100),&#10;        &#39;top_contributor&#39;: max(weights, key=lambda k: normalize(data.get(k, 0)) * weights[k]),&#10;        &#39;biggest_drag&#39;: min(weights, key=lambda k: normalize(data.get(k, 0)) * weights[k]),&#10;        &#39;action&#39;: generate_action(score, data)&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"backgroun